# Built .mcpb artifacts. dist/ is ignored EXCEPT the canonical release bundle, which
# IS committed: its SHA-256 is a published contract (server.json.fileSha256 + the release
# SHA256SUMS), so it must be reviewable and the consistency gate must run on every PR.
# `mcpb pack` is nondeterministic, so re-pack only when the source changes, then update
# server.json.fileSha256 (see README.md and tempdoc 726).
dist/*
!dist/justsearch-mcp.mcpb
